# The fixture mirrors under fixtures/origin are bare git repositories stored
# in-tree. Treat every byte inside them as binary so that core.autocrlf never
# rewrites line endings on checkout: a stray CR turns a ref into
# "refs/heads/main\r", which git reports as a "funny ref" and then reads as an
# empty repository. The blobs are committed as LF, so Linux cloners are fine
# either way; this keeps Windows checkouts byte-faithful too.
fixtures/origin/** -text
